{"4321680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Healer", "steam_appid": 4321680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healer</strong> is a <strong>boss rush</strong> combining <strong>healing</strong> and <strong>action roguelike</strong> mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stupid teammates are worse than bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will move when you ask but that's about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then they will complain if you don't save them from certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, heal and survive until the end to see how it went !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability tree : 10 stats + 15 custom nodes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >teammates class selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcade ranking</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healer</strong> is a <strong>boss rush</strong> combining <strong>healing</strong> and <strong>action roguelike</strong> mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stupid teammates are worse than bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will move when you ask but that's about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then they will complain if you don't save them from certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, heal and survive until the end to see how it went !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >abilit